// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : AntonioNashSSA2_2 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Antonio Nash 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P943755051" "Antonio Nash"
// ProfessionString :
"P2831611835" "GIFT Special Investigator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1277770035" "Since the destruction of Galaxy City, the FBSA has been scrambling to reassign its personnel to more effective positions in Paragon City. Antonio Nash, formerly the New Hero Liaison for GIFT, has been reassigned to a more direct investigative role. His focused research on the effects of Superadine flew to the top of the priority list when a group of Trolls, led by Atta, went on a rampage through Skyway City and defeated two prominent members of the Freedom Phalanx. Now Nash has been caught up in the investigation of Pandora's Box, and what possible ties it could have - if any - with the Trolls and their designer drug of choice."
// LocationString :
"P2752802251" "Atlas Park"
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P2559913958" "<color orange>In order to play Antonio's storyarc, you must be either a Hero or Vigilante, and will need to have purchased the second episode of the second signature story arc, <i>Pandora's Box</i>, or be a VIP subscriber."
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3271710088" "<color orange>Antonio flips out his badge.</color><br><br>{HeroName}? Antonio Nash, Genetic Investigation and Facilitation. I've been assigned to work with you and the Phalanx in tracking down the artifact known as Pandora's Box. I'll be making my department's resources available to you, to assist you in your search.<br><br>I'll be honest, {HeroName}. This assignment... well, I specialize in Superadine research, and the recent incident with the Trolls has my bosses on edge. They want me looking into how Superadine could have made the Trolls strong enough to take down members of the Phalanx.<br><br>There's just one problem: there's no way Superadine could have done that. Supes is capable of some spectacular changes in human physiology, but it still has to follow the biological limits of the user. When Atta and the Trolls attacked Skyway... well, I don't know what was fueling them, but it wasn't Superadine.<br><br>But my assignment is what it is, and I need to help you track down this artifact before someone else gets their tyrannical hands on it and starts breaking things. That's a cause I can get behind."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2509199547" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}. I’m under explicit instructions not to work with any Heroes below Security Level 35. It's a legal liability thing, completely out of my hands."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3440163931" "You're too high level"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P3447788615" "You team needs to be bigger"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P3158803778" "<color orange>Antonio opens up his notebook and begins flipping through pages.</color><br><br>{HeroName}? Hmm... I'm not seeing you listed here as a squad leader. I'm afraid I can't work with you directly... could you refer me to the leader of your team?"
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P997500560" "We're just about ready to roll, {HeroName}, but you're going to need your whole crew here before we begin. It's a policy thing, my hands are tied."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P3288737593" "I'm sorry, {HeroName}. I’m under explicit instructions not to work with any Heroes below Security Level 30. It's a legal liability thing, completely out of my hands."
// TaskForceName :
"P2688458309" "This is never referenced"
// TaskForceName :
"P3953293552" "Yellow"
// TaskForceName :
"P3573665398" "Orange"
// TaskForceName :
"P2309856811" "Floppy"
// HelloString :
"P1900544985" "I'm not sure how much help I can be to you, {HeroName}, but I'll give it my all."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P472636015" "Don't know you"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1261189394" "No Tasks Remaining"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P856364347" ""
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4104236529" "Fail"
