// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Wavelength 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Wavelength 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P4032079076" "Wavelength"
// ProfessionString :
// DescriptionString :
"P1474472524" "Wavelength is one of Paragon City's most storied living heroes, having served with the Freedom Phalanx in the 1970s. She left Paragon City when she married Lord Pyre, former archvillain and ruler of the Island of Dante.<br><br>Upon hearing the news of Statesman's death, however, Wavelength returned to Paragon City out of concern for the city of her birth. She now assists the Freedom Phalanx's new leader, Positron, by acting as a liaison between the Phalanx and other freelance Heroes."
// LocationString :
// InteractionRequiresText :
"P738766328" "Hello, dear. It's ever so nice to see young heroes out and about these days. I'm afraid I won't be able to stay and chat, however. My old team has been hit with some hard times, you see, so I'm trying to lend a hand.<br><br><color orange>You will need to have purchased the first episode of the second signature story arc, <i>Pandora's Box</i>, or be a VIP subscriber before you can play Wavelength's storyarc.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P3296510025" "Hello, {HeroName}. My name is <color yellow>Wavelength</color>, but I'm sure that doesn't mean much to you. My glory days were probably well before your time.<br><br>I <i>have</i> heard of you, however, and I've got to say, I'm impressed. Not many heroes today have faced what you have, and lived. When Positron put you on the short list of heroes he wanted me to contact, I wasn't surprised.<br><br>Long story short, {HeroName}... the Freedom Phalanx is in a rough place right now. I've been asked to seek out heroes with experience, who can help give them support when they need it most. If you're willing to assist, please speak with Positron as soon as you're able."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P3752421432" "Keep at it, friend. Every life you save, and every villain you face, will only make you stronger. One day, you may even be strong enough to help me."
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P2837845833" "You're quite the powerhouse, aren't you? Oh, don't let me bother you, friend. I assure you, the concerns of an old woman are not worth your time."
// NeedLargeTeam :
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P1617745647" "If I'm going to talk with one of you, it's going to need to represent everyone. Why don't you bring your team leader on by, and we'll have a chat."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P438404390" "If you're going to work with me, I need to know that everyone is present and able. Why don't you come back once you've gathered your friends, hm?"
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1726874299" "I'm sorry, but your friend there is a little... inexperienced for what I have in mind. Don't you worry about it, though, if you all keep at it, you'll grow stronger before you know it."
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// TaskForceName :
// HelloString :
"P2002279011" "I'm glad you're here, {HeroName}."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

